        <detaileddescription>
<para>Register Document.</para>
<para>When no QueryEngine is wired in, <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_legal_auto_labeler_1a6ee0eb4c3a9817a48bcdcc92a6118a95" kindref="member">labelDocument()</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput>fetchDocumentText()</computeroutput> look up documents registered here instead of falling back to a fixed hardcoded placeholder paragraph. This allows unit and integration tests to exercise the full NLP pipeline with controlled, per-document texts without requiring a live database.</para>
<para>Documents registered via this method take precedence over the built-in hardcoded fallback text. They do not affect the AQL-backed code path: when a QueryEngine is present, the DB always wins.</para>
